  <item>
    <title>98.【影戏】从《陆澹盦侦探影戏小说集》看普世的人生缩影</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/686b6b5193fd2d72b8eaedd0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">686b6b5193fd2d72b8eaedd0</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 07 Jul 2025 06:42:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2025年7月6日，在上海图书馆和战玉冰、华斯比二位老师做了一场《陆澹盦侦探影戏小说集》的分享。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoeDG0-s6ibBhPNMEVOnX9-AXu0N.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmCUkXTRB0HOAuFJrTVbNohj7xFo.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>《陆澹盦侦探影戏小说集》，上海人民出版社最新出版。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtnktcsU6wjPZhKACP6zEUOVhqzW.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;陆澹盦</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvjL-CdIDGMaJgDZQxCV3RMgP7a0.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="842">14:02</a> &nbsp;民国时代的美国连续影片与影戏小说的形成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1304">21:44</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;“影戏”的中外名称</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu_vNIWrpvU61aH9ujHk3zkbE_jo.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2031">33:51</a> &nbsp;译？著？改编？译介？一百年前的署名迷雾</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq4bv8xUqHvuHUPQ3IgzpstiV16l.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2766">46:06</a> 《陆澹盦侦探影戏小说集》封面设计的机关</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmYRUPKmVDTLeW9IcR2wI1_-d8MO.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3571">59:31</a> &nbsp;华斯比老师的搜书救书截书藏书花絮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4456">1:14:16</a> 时人同行是如何评价侦探影戏说的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4864">1:21:04</a> &nbsp;影戏小说里的永恒套路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5656">1:34:16</a> &nbsp;中日同款改译小说版本的考证</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7250">2:00:50</a> 1948年，与方沛霖同场竞技的初代《美国队长》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjKd6WuQsRCWzl1Geh1F61LR3fYl.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期节目小宇宙&amp;网易云同步上线。</span></p>]]></description>
